# This layer does not use terraform.tfvars.
#
# Normal configuration - region and org_prefix - lives in ../config.yaml, which
# is committed. Everything else about the cluster is read live from the cluster
# itself (data.aws_eks_cluster), so there is nothing to configure here.
#
# One value is not committed, because it carries the account id. Supply it from
# the gitignored ../.env:
#
#   source ../.env
#   terraform plan
#
# ../.env should contain:
#
#   export TF_VAR_account_id=REPLACE-WORKLOAD-ACCOUNT-ID
#
# This layer creates IAM roles, an SQS queue and EventBridge rules; it does not
# need admin_principal_arns. A terraform.tfvars here would still be auto-loaded
# and override the config above, so this file is kept as a pointer only.
